			"notes": "- Film is loaded into the camera: click film onto it in your inventory, as into a bundle. It holds 16 film, blank and exposed together.\n- Exposed film stays in the camera until you right-click the camera with nothing held to take it out.\n- Sneak and right-click a block to set the camera down, facing the way you look. Power it with redstone and it takes a picture through its lens.\n- Use film on a placed camera to load it, and an empty hand to take its exposed film out. Broken, it drops with its film inside.\n- A placed camera's picture is drawn by the nearest player's game, unseen; they need Pandorical 15.22 or later."
		},
